<title>USA: Standard Management Corp Q3 net higher.</title>
<headline>Standard Management Corp Q3 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.14		   $ 0.08</p>
<p> Net			    704			445</p>
<p> Revs			 7,969		    7,104</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,940		    5,376</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>1996 Q3 net includes gain from early retirement of preferred stock of $233,000 or $0.04 a share.  </p>
<p>	  NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.74		   $ 0.18</p>
<p> Net			  3,821			979</p>
<p> Revs			29,865		   21,392</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,299		    5,348</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 nine months net includes gain from disposal of subsidiaries of $2.3 million, and gain on early retirement of preferred stock of $500,000.</p>
<p>1995 nine months net includes decrease in accrual for class action litigation and settlement costs of $314,000.</p>
<p>	     Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787</p>
